# Shell scripts keep LF on every checkout: the Windows CI job runs scripts/ci/telegram-send.sh
# with Git Bash, and the runner's Git converts text files to CRLF (core.autocrlf), which bash
# cannot run ($'\r': command not found). T-070.
*.sh text eol=lf
# Raw PCM assets (include_bytes!) are never converted on any checkout: a CRLF rewrite
# would change the samples the Windows build embeds. T-046.
*.s16le binary
